Provides: fbrowser-kiosk
Replaces: fbrowser-kiosk
Breaks: fbrowser-kiosk
Description: QtWebEngine kiosk browser for the Linux framebuffer
 Single-window web browser drawing straight onto /dev/fb0, with no X server
 or Wayland compositor. Derived from e1z0/Framebuffer-browser, reduced to the
 kiosk window and ported to Qt 6.
 .
 Ships a template user unit, odio-kiosk@.service, not enabled: one instance
 per screen, each naming the page it shows and the framebuffer it draws on.
 .
 Named fbrowser-kiosk up to 1.0.0, when the binary and the unit carried
 different names. It replaces that package.
